{"v":4,"catch":"Zombie Derby是殭屍啟示錄世界中的一個小型3D賽車行動。","desc":"末日來臨，快開車逃跑吧！掌握你的汽車，看看你是否能夠真正逃脫。擁有5款可升級的汽車，精美的3D圖形和血腥蹣跚的身體，殭屍德比(Zombie Derby)是一個殺手遊戲。在他們抓住你之前，你能跑多遠？\n\n主要特色\n\n• 駕駛5輛殺手車\n• 5個級別進行探索\n• 3個極限級別\n• 大規模定製的車輛\n\n駕駛求生！","publisher":"Brinemedia","release":"2024-06-06","genres":["競速","街機","動作","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"ClassⅡ","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/064d88f3b56a5802403cb42da47dd7d4d46e48bcfd6fcae2e507778ca601f779.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/23813df878fba29a813eea8e98089c276198faae4713de0839bbea621139e088.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bf44c176113fc8a97b72a8c8935ef0bc7548329a648f8a5b1ad599c52a551d31.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3460dea88fb5384ffa81f26e6906a78a2994247fb8b5b656da973f8bb53a46a8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1bc469fa51f14d80ff9b15acd4f2263a9096e48bdba423a255d22942c0794c80.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a7701f34a000","dlc":[]}